              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "CLAIMED: of 613756 crosses the corpus's own integers generate, 514609 are forced by an operator's algebra, 453 are stated, and 98694 remain — and the three account for the whole, 514609 + 453 + 98694 = 613756."
