              "type": "code",
              "language": "lean",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "theorem most_of_the_unstated_remainder_stays_inside_one_wing : ((43772 * 5 > 98694 * 2) ∧ (43772 * 2 < 98694)) ∧ (43772 < 98694) := by decide"
